b\ c\)\[CenterDot]\(a : \(b\^2 + c\^2 - a\^2\)\/\(2  b\ c\)\) = \(\(2  R\ a\)\
\/\(2  a\ b\ c\)\[CenterDot]Sen[A] : 
              Cos[A] = \(R\ a\ Tan[A]\)\/\(a\ b\ c\)\)\)\)\)], "Input"],

